  "prefLabel": "Ins 4104.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4104.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide requirements for filing large employer group health insurance rates and to establish standards for determining the reasonableness of the relationship of benefits to premiums.\n\nSource. #9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #12799, eff 6-10-19",
